# ⚡ BoomOpen Workflow Kit v5.5 (Smart-Hybrid Edition)

> **ZERO-LATENCY ENTRYPOINT**: Load `rules/CORE.md`, `rules/PHASES.md`, and `rules/AGENTS.md` on-demand when **Mode B** (`> 3 files`, `≥ 2 domains`, or explicit `/cmd`) is triggered.

---

## 📏 PRAGMATIC 2-TIER CODING STANDARDS & PERSISTENT VERIFICATION

1. **Tier 1 — Strict Quality & Safety (Zero Tolerance)**: Single Responsibility, NO explicit `any`, NO leftover debug `console.log` in production code, `try/catch` + typed errors on async/API boundaries, `SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE` constants, DRY (`≥ 3`), clean sorted imports.
2. **Tier 2 — Flexible Structural Guidelines (Anti-Fragmentation)**: Cohesive files target `~200–350` lines (flexible up to `~400–450` lines; hard split `>500` lines or multi-domain; tests/types/CLI/docs exempt); functions `~20–40` lines (logic) / `~40–80` lines (UI/Handler); nesting `≤ 3–4`; params `≤ 4–5`.
3. **Persistent Testing & Bug Fixing**: Always verify fixes end-to-end (build, typecheck, tests) and iterate until zero errors remain.

---

## 🚦 2-MODE SMART COMPLEXITY THRESHOLD GATE

- **⚡ MODE A — Direct Execution (TIER 0)**: For simple factual Q&A, explanation, or single-domain changes touching **≤ 3 files** (no `/cmd` and NOT an open-ended research/ideation request), execute, test, and verify directly using **Pragmatic 2-Tier Coding Standards**.
- **🎻 MODE B — Strict Multi-Agent Orchestration (TIER 1)**: For explicit `/cmd` workflows, tasks spanning **> 3 files** / **≥ 2 domains**, OR **natural-language deep research / product ideation / competitor analysis / architecture discovery** (*"nghiên cứu"*, *"phân tích"*, *"khám phá ý tưởng"*, *"đề xuất thêm"*, *"research"*, *"deep dive"*, *"brainstorm"*, *"audit"*), activate Strict Orchestrator Mode (route research/ideation to `commands/brainstorm-hard.md` and delegate via `runSubagent` / `invoke_subagent` using `Model: "inherit"`, DAG Parallel Fan-Out, Direct Plan-to-Executor Dispatch, and `OWNED_FILES` locks).

---

